# Env files: ignore everything, allow only public, secret-free ones.
# Production values come from the host/CI environment, never from files.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.development
!.env.e2e
!.env.test

# Claude Code: ignore everything under .claude/ by default (local settings,
# worktrees, caches, session data), then allow only shared project config.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
# Personal, per-machine instructions
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md